# Environment Variables (Root)

This file documents shared environment variables used across services.

```env
# Global
ENV=development
LOG_LEVEL=info

# Database
POSTGRES_HOST=localhost
POSTGRES_PORT=5432
POSTGRES_USER=enterprise
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=enterprise
POSTGRES_DB=enterprise_ai
POSTGRES_SSL_MODE=disable
POSTGRES_MAX_OPEN_CONNS=25
POSTGRES_MAX_IDLE_CONNS=5
POSTGRES_CONN_MAX_LIFETIME=30m
POSTGRES_CONN_MAX_IDLE_TIME=5m

# Redis
REDIS_HOST=localhost
REDIS_PORT=6379
REDIS_PASSWORD=
REDIS_DB=0

# Object Storage
S3_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:9000
S3_ACCESS_KEY=minio
S3_SECRET_KEY=minio123
S3_BUCKET=enterprise-docs
S3_REGION=us-east-1
S3_USE_SSL=false

# Vector DB
MILVUS_HOST=localhost
MILVUS_PORT=19530

# JWT
JWT_SIGNING_KEY=change-me
JWT_ISSUER=enterprise-ai-auth
JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_TTL=1h
JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_TTL=168h
JWT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL=5m
```
